WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.750
It’s an unusually calm moment in the SCP
Foundation.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:08.500
No one is in the hall besides a scientist,
and a young female subject.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.260
There are no tests going on, just observation.

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:17.160
The scientist calmly asks her questions as
he escorts her down the hallway, hoping to

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:21.119
get more insight into her unique abilities.

00:00:21.119 --> 00:00:24.009
So why does she look so utterly terrified?

00:00:24.009 --> 00:00:28.929
As the scientist tries to get her attention,
the young woman becomes more preoccupied,

00:00:28.929 --> 00:00:30.720
staring nervously around the hallway.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.750
Does she fear the scientist?

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:36.460
Why does she keep muttering strange phrases
that don’t make any sense?

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:38.700
“How did it break through such a heavy door?”

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.050
“That door is nearly a foot thick.

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:43.110
How did it manage to destroy it?”

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:47.010
The scientist is looking at his notes and
tries to make sense of the young woman’s

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:49.519
statements when he notices something terrible.

00:00:49.519 --> 00:00:55.620
She’s staring at one of the doors containing
another, highly dangerous SCP in top-of-the-line

00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:56.620
restraints.

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:59.750
But it’s safely locked away - right?

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:04.129
The scientist swears he can hear the sound
of scratching behind the steel door...

00:01:04.129 --> 00:01:09.590
It was seventeen hours later when the dangerous
SCP broke out of its containment cell, and

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:14.210
could have laid waste to the entire SCP containment
facility - if it wasn’t for the heavily

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:18.730
armed response team waiting outside to contain
it and return it to its cell.

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:23.710
The huge loss of life was only avoided because
the SCP Foundation had advance warning.

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:30.890
All thanks to the greatest secret weapon the
foundation has ever seen, SCP-187.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:35.490
But the Foundation’s most powerful defense
against dangerous SCPs is probably its most

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:41.229
unlikely - a completely normal-looking young
woman, in her early 20s, whose only distinguishing

00:01:41.229 --> 00:01:44.490
characteristic is how thin and haunted she
looks.

00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:49.340
Despite being no danger to anyone in the foundation,
she’s one of the most carefully guarded

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:53.400
SCPs in the facility - to protect her from
herself.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:59.740
SCP-187 is one of the most powerful precognitives
ever found - but her abilities are a danger

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:01.829
to her own mind.

00:02:01.829 --> 00:02:06.360
This average looking girl has a unique telepathic
ability where she can see into the future

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:12.000
of whatever she’s looking at - seeing it
simultaneously in two frames of existence.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.750
She sees it as it is now, as well as what
it will look like in the future.

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:19.410
Say, for instance she’s looking at a baby
tiger cub.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:21.140
Aww, cute.

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:26.330
At the same time, she also sees the massive,
fearsome jungle beast it’ll become.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:30.659
She won’t see minor changes to its state
- so she won’t be able to tell you how your

00:02:30.659 --> 00:02:36.250
next haircut will look - but if something
drastic is about to happen to someone or something,

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:39.360
she’ll be able to predict it with perfect
accuracy.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:44.459
There’s only one problem - she can’t turn
it off.

00:02:44.459 --> 00:02:48.590
This involuntary ability goes off whenever
she sees someone or something that’s about

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:51.640
to undergo a major change in its status.

00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:56.310
This means that at any time, she can be bombarded
with horrible visuals.

00:02:56.310 --> 00:02:59.730
And that even includes food.

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:05.110
Ever since her abilities kicked in, SCP-187
has been unable to eat normally because whatever

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:08.900
she eats or drinks, she sees in its future
state.

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:13.170
When she looks at a glass of water, she’ll
see it as liquid - but a little more yellow

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:15.620
than it usually is.

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:20.290
As for solid food, she’ll see it as what
it comes out as after it’s been digested.

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:24.799
Not exactly appetizing, so for a while it
looked like she was likely to starve herself

00:03:24.799 --> 00:03:27.519
to death in the Foundation’s custody.

00:03:27.519 --> 00:03:31.489
Fortunately, the administration’s scientists
were able to find some work-arounds around

00:03:31.489 --> 00:03:32.620
her ability.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:36.739
Feeding and hydrating her intravenously was
an option, but further study of her abilities

00:03:36.739 --> 00:03:40.349
made clear that her power was processed through
her eyes.

00:03:40.349 --> 00:03:44.060
That means that when she’s blindfolded,
she’s able to eat without her precognition

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:45.689
kicking in.

00:03:45.689 --> 00:03:51.750
Being assigned to the detail for SCP-187 is
very different from most SCP details.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:56.459
If you’re assigned to SCP-682, you’re
constantly worried that the horrible carnivorous

00:03:56.459 --> 00:04:01.879
beast with a hatred for all things human is
going to get loose and tear you to shreds.

00:04:01.879 --> 00:04:04.849
Not so much with SCP-187.

00:04:04.849 --> 00:04:09.620
This duty is more like a medical team, where
the patient is highly valuable to the institution

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:13.800
and can’t be allowed to get free or to harm
themselves in any way.

00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:19.080
The foundation has taken the highest precautions
to ensure SCP-187 is safe, including a set

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:23.690
of medical restraints that she’s strapped
into except when out of her cell or participating

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:25.250
in tests.

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:29.450
Even when given more freedom, her hands are
always in soft mittens - to keep her from

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:33.590
trying to damage her own eyes as a way to
neutralize her powers.

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:38.340
Her team blindfolds her before every mealtime
and feeds her, with some mild sedatives added

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.970
to her food to keep her calm.

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:44.880
Through consistent care, she’s starting
to recover from her self-induced starvation.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:49.040
The personnel chosen for this assignment are
carefully screened before being sent in to

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.230
interact with her.

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:55.830
They need to be the most responsible and detail-oriented
members of the staff, who won’t miss a thing

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:58.410
when it comes to her care routine.

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:03.530
Just because 187 is harmless doesn’t mean
she can’t move fast, and one misstep could

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:07.300
cost the Foundation their most valuable asset.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:12.530
And unlike most SCPs, 187 is rarely handled
by D-class personnel.

00:05:12.530 --> 00:05:17.100
They don’t have access to higher-security
specimens, and they don’t have the training

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:18.840
due to their short tenure.

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:23.480
But there’s another reason the foundation
keeps 187 away from the lowest men on the

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:25.040
totem pole.

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:29.940
D-Class personnel are frequently used to test
out dangerous SCPs, and are lucky if they

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:32.330
get to the end of their service intact.

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:36.980
When she was exposed to some D-Class Personnel
early in her stay, she saw them as horribly

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:41.270
bloated, with holes in their heads, or missing
half their body.

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:46.670
Those unfortunate personnel soon met horrible
fates - sucked out into the vacuum of space,

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:51.520
shot while trying to escape, and bitten in
half by an escaping anomalous creature.

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:56.201
Additionally, while most D-Class Personnel
are amnesticized after their service, some

00:05:56.201 --> 00:06:00.090
are terminated for breaking protocol or trying
to escape.

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:06.030
SCP-187 would see any of these unfortunate
personnel walking around as the corpses they’d

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:07.170
wind up as.

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:12.300
The Foundation wants to learn the full extent
of her powers though, and this means tests,

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:14.030
lots of tests.

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:17.630
When she first came into the Foundation’s
care, they were focused on figuring out how

00:06:17.630 --> 00:06:18.930
her power worked.

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:23.110
They gave her IQ tests, and she got every
answer right on the written test.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:28.410
Her IQ was measured as being off the charts,
at least 300, which would make her the smartest

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:33.450
person alive - but her normal behavior didn’t
seem to match up with this level of super

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:34.710
intelligence.

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:39.480
Confusing them even more, when she was given
a computerized IQ test, she scored slightly

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:42.990
below average - with a score of 97.

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:47.250
The scientists assigned to her case studied
the results and created other tests until

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:50.720
they understood how her precognitive ability
works.

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:53.930
She can see the future of anything that’s
physically affected.

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:58.170
So when an answer is marked down on a piece
of paper, that’s a notable change - but

00:06:58.170 --> 00:07:02.710
when an entry is typed into a computer, the
computer remains the same.

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:06.690
So her ability wasn’t able to help her on
the computerized tests.

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:11.750
But her abilities could still help the Foundation,
especially when it comes to improving security

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:13.460
for other anomalies.

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:18.110
She had inadvertently prevented the escape
of an especially deadly SCP creature by predicting

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:23.860
it would break through the door, but how would
her powers manifest in more complicated cases?

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:28.040
Some Foundation researchers postulated that
she might be able to see into the future of

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:34.071
deadly, indestructible anomalies like SCP-682
and figure out a way to eliminate it, but

00:07:34.071 --> 00:07:38.370
temporal experts warned this could create
a paradox.

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:43.140
After all, she would be looking at an elimination
protocol that didn’t exist until she looked

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:44.140
at it.

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:48.370
But her powers and how they might help in
other ways other than neutralization warranted

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:55.530
further exploration so personnel were assigned,
and the SCP-187 experiments began.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:08:01.050
SCP-162 is a horrible mass of fish-hooks,
wire, and other sharp implements.

00:08:01.050 --> 00:08:06.120
It exudes a psychological pull, and any unfortunate
person who touches it winds up being pulled

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:09.840
in by the barbed objects and absorbed into
its mass.

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:15.350
SCP-187 was kept at a safe distance and examined
it - and was undisturbed.

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:19.550
She saw it only as a pile of melted slag,
indicating that it would be neutralized at

00:08:19.550 --> 00:08:20.900
some point.

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:26.000
SCP-529, a normal and friendly cat except
for the fact that its back half appears to

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:27.590
be completely missing.

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:32.701
The cat acts as if it’s whole, and when
SCP-187 was exposed to it, she didn’t seem

00:08:32.701 --> 00:08:34.840
to notice anything wrong with the cat.

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:39.740
She played with it briefly, and seemed to
be calmer than any other time she was examined.

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:44.890
The Foundation is considering using SCP-529
as a motivating tool after she requested to

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:46.500
revisit it.

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:52.580
Other tests had much more disturbing results,
as SCP-187 discovered things about subjects

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:56.880
that researchers were previously unaware of.

00:08:56.880 --> 00:09:03.460
SCP-003, a strange organic circuit board made
of hair and nails attached to a stone tablet,

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:05.590
appears to be an ancient machine.

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:10.670
But when SCP-187 was introduced to it, she
greeted it like a person and had a conversation

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:13.450
with it as the staff looked on confused.

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:17.970
When she was interviewed after, she described
the entity as “A very nice lady”.

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:20.830
What was SCP-003 evolving into?

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:25.890
The foundation is studying it closely thanks
to SCP-187’s advance warning.

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:31.480
When exposed to SCP-015, a massive network
of pipes that seems to be slowly growing and

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:38.240
defends itself from any attempts to work on
it with tools, SCP-187 observed few differences

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:42.180
from its current state - until she opened
a door.

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:48.840
Inside, she reported a massive network of
pipes reaching for miles, with no end in sight.

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:55.980
SCP-015 had been reduced to a manageable site
and its danger had been contained - but SCP-187

00:09:55.980 --> 00:10:01.790
indicated that it may be getting ready for
its biggest and most dangerous expansion yet.

00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:07.560
SCP-415, a seemingly normal human man with
an ability to regenerate his internal organs,

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:12.750
has been a subject of the Foundation’s investigations
since his arrival - particularly due to the

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:17.370
strange physical alterations he underwent
to make easier access to his organs.

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:23.270
He’s one of the more peaceful SCPs at the
foundation - but as soon as SCP-187 was exposed

00:10:23.270 --> 00:10:25.810
to him, she became disturbed.

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:29.740
She begged to be removed from the room, and
upon interrogation, revealed that she saw

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:33.490
SCP-415 as a deceased corpse.

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:36.720
What is going to happen to the seemingly immortal
man?

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:43.270
SCP-187 was also exposed to some of the more
dangerous SCPs in the Foundation, including

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:49.370
SCP-173, a seemingly living statue that moves
in unpredictable ways whenever it isn’t

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:53.580
observed and has been responsible for the
deaths of many D-Class Personnel who enter

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:55.510
its enclosure for cleaning.

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:57.930
But it seems to be stable in containment.

00:10:57.930 --> 00:11:03.670
So why, when exposed to it, did SCP-187 begin
screaming immediately, have to be removed

00:11:03.670 --> 00:11:07.730
from the enclosure, and fall into a catatonic
state for two days?

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:11.660
She remembered nothing from the vision she
had of the statue, and it took days for her

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:12.990
to recover fully.

00:11:12.990 --> 00:11:18.780
The foundation is keeping a close eye on the
statue, even closer than they were before.

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:24.930
SCP-106, also known as The Old Man, a depraved
killer resembling an elderly rotting corpse,

00:11:24.930 --> 00:11:29.190
is known for its frequent escapes and sadistic
attacks on anyone near it.

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:34.810
When exposed to SCP-187, the observation lasted
less than a minute before the Old Man attempted

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:36.000
to escape.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:41.820
SCP-187 looked to be in direct danger from
the Old Man, but he never touched her or harmed

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:43.450
her in any way.

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:48.130
When she was interviewed after, she explained
that the Old Man wanted an audience, someone

00:11:48.130 --> 00:11:49.260
to watch it.

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:53.480
The incident was recorded as a close call
- and an indication that some of the other

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:57.310
entities may have their own plans for SCP-187.

00:11:57.310 --> 00:12:02.870
SCP-187’s power works without fail, and
that tempts many people to try to use her

00:12:02.870 --> 00:12:05.510
to get answers to important questions.

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:10.380
But they should be careful what they wish
for, as one Doctor found out during an examination.

00:12:10.380 --> 00:12:16.140
SCP-187 looked at the woman’s hand and observed
that it was odd she wasn’t wearing her wedding

00:12:16.140 --> 00:12:17.260
ring.

00:12:17.260 --> 00:12:20.940
But the Doctor was - and had been for the
last nineteen years.

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:30.000
But the next day, her husband filed for divorce,
and SCP-187’s prophecies proved, once again,

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.000
correct.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:33.850
So what are the future plans for SCP-187?

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:38.800
The Foundation is being careful with her abilities,
both to preserve her sanity and to prevent

00:12:38.800 --> 00:12:40.510
any potential time paradoxes.

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:45.340
A routine has been established to keep her
safe, fed, and protected from some of the

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:47.260
worst effects of her ability.

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:51.720
But the experiments using her visions aren’t
going to stop any time soon.

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:56.170
Many of her visions predicted dangerous new
evolutions in Keter class anomalies, giving

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:59.840
the team time to prepare and up security measures.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:05.930
No one knows where SCP-187 came from or what
the source of her unique abilities is, but

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:10.430
while the SCP Foundation is keeping some of
the most dangerous entities in the world safely

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:15.190
locked away, their most valuable asset may
be one of the most harmless.

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:20.840
Because as long as SCP-187 has her visions,
the next breakout or apocalyptic event can

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:24.240
be stopped in its tracks before it happens.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:31.330
For more on some of the subjects SCP-187 interacted
with, check out “SCP-106 - The Old Man Escape”

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:33.910
or “SCP-173 - The Sculpture Tale”.

